  "body_html": "<h1>evaluate_at_mixed_linear</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma evaluate_at_mixed_linear (i : N) (σ : MixedS G) (τ : stdSimplex ℝ (G.strategy i)) : evaluate_at_mixed G i (update σ i τ) = ∑ a : G.strategy i, (τ.val a) * evaluate_at_mixed G i (update σ i (stdSimplex.pure a))</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>MixedS</li>\n<li>Strategy</li>\n<li>evaluate_at_mixed</li>\n<li>stdSimplex.pure</li>\n<li>Lottery.pure</li>\n<li>Profile.ext</li>\n<li>stdSimplex.pure_apply</li>\n</ul>",
